================================================================================
ACADEMIC ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

The reward shaping (heading term plus gated forward-progress term) is adapted from:
  A. Kalapos, C. Gor, R. Moni, I. Harmati, "Sim-to-real reinforcement learning applied to
  end-to-end vehicle control", ISMCR 2020, arXiv:2012.07461; extended in
  ACTA IMEKO 10(3):7-14, 2021.

The image encoder follows the Impoola design:
  N. Trumpp et al., "Impoola: The Power of Average Pooling for Image-Based Deep Reinforcement
  Learning", 2025, arXiv:2503.05546.

No code from either work is copied; both are reimplemented from their published descriptions.
